    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "BOEING\n737-300\nSAFETY\nINSTRUCTIONS\nCHINA YUNNAN AIRLINES",
      "1827.\n0470",
      "FASTEN SEAT BELT TIGHT \u0026 LOW\nFasten\n1T11F\nLUGGAGE LOCATION\nTighten\nUnfasten\nBRACE FOR IMPACT\nNO SMOKING EVERYWHERE IN THE AIRCRAFT\n127 E\n11511\nNo use during taking\noff, landing and\nturbulence.\nDO NOT USE ELECTRONIC DEVICES\nDuring taking off and landing,\nplease stow the table and adjust\nthe seat to the normal position.\nEMERGENCY EXITS\nEXIT\nLIFE VEST\nOXYGEN MASK\nDitching\nFLOATATION CUSHION\nDOOR LOCATION \u0026 EVACUATION ROUTES\nDITCHING EVACUATION\nUse Battom Cushion\nFor Flotation.\n####:\n1748(30);\nThe conducts below are strictly prohibited in aircraft:\n1 Violent behaviors:\n2 Vying for seats and overhead compartments;\n3 The use of mobile telephones, compact disc\nplayers and othere iectronic apparatuses;\n4 Stealing, impairing or removing lifesaving devices;\n5 Threatening safe operation or disturbing cabin order.\nLANDING EVACUATION\nPlease do not remove this card from the aircraft\n2001 077.003"
    ],
